  letterId: passout_neighbor
  senderName: A worried neighbor
  senderSubtitle: 
  subject: Are you okay?
  body: 'Hello,


    I found you asleep on the path in the middle of the night.
    You gave me quite a scare! A few of us helped get you to the clinic.


    I
    know running a shop on your own is a lot of work, but please don''t push yourself
    so hard. Go to bed before the moon gets too high, okay?'
  signOff: Take care of yourself.
